    "A longer paragraph continues in the next post (1/2, 2/2), cut between sentences. Auto picks, for each book, the smallest limit that fits 95% of its paragraphs in one post (at least 40 words). Focus mode shows only the text of each post. Post text size is in points: type a number or use − and +, in steps of 0.5. The default, 16.5, and the line spacing match the X iPhone app. The accessibility text sizes in iOS Settings still make posts larger. Scroll back through the book: in One book mode, scroll up past where you started to read earlier posts, back to the start of the book. Your place stays at the furthest post you read." : {},
